<details style="margin:22px 0;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:white;">
<summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#0f766e;">Quick check: What does document.getElementById("tipButton") return?</summary>
<p style="margin:12px 0 0;">A reference to the HTML element whose id is tipButton, if that element exists.</p>
</details>
